                <pb facs="0139" n="133" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg133"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-11-23"><hi rendition="#italic">November 23,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Secretary of state for foreign affairs has presented impressive reasons for not
                    withdrawing seal fishery negotiations from British ambassador at Washington.
                    Satisfactory explanation by cable impracticable. Will communicate
                    immediately.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
